Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 07:36:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(windows): complete desktop notifications and audio

Own Shell notification icons from a dedicated message-only window and pump their callbacks so pseudoconsole clients can display and clean up queued banners.

Wait for MediaPlayer's known duration instead of dispatcher events, preserve the existing literal path binding and timeout, and include stderr in playback failures.
